 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bjfdr10MjbUQ7kNvwHKEhFB&_nc_oc=Adp_TXKLtuoF5n0AbyHA_RIX9Q0MNTXQ_vF_2pt3bd7V9QJelfxiBph_3rP-ktpD0_k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPzVKR7GbWerYNuk6nkd4059PZ4rVcZAf5d0Kp6jVflRQ&oe=6AC3BFC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t2OKWVvxMEUQ7kNvwF729Jr&_nc_oc=AdplXo0F-tP3N08TwuHW8CJ4fPp8-8VW3QR0BnY5m7-9-nOPm3K2sg3YHIguUD0gA2c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN3k7bARyTN2Kw8-29iHjySS_VMvdcSaYudAN-gqF9pJw&oe=6AC3CD26"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RwwQ9TQargEQ7kNvwEQ1r0C&_nc_oc=Adrqdqv6nFTnnk35mWIRGMdN6-djjoCVWFZ4j8Jz0gxWyC3W3_kafSIBWR62F2hsnh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNXlQxubH66BnTd0soi7C0TXXX4-3P492oo3jt2PYfKHg&oe=6AC3D71C"}, {"fil